/11225574?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39","html_url":"https://github.com/dezren39","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"status":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Parent: [#6019](https://github.com/developing-today/code/issues/6019) (semi-automated ingestion operations). Research source: prior-art doc `~/workspace/scratch/atlas-ingestion-brief-2026-11-04/prior-art-research.md` (2026-11-04). Follow-up 40 (Cluster 7).\n\n## Finding (research, in substance)\n\nPublished prices (verified Sept–Oct 2026 by comparison sources): OpenAI text-embedding-3-small **$0.02/1M tokens** ($0.01 batch), 3-large $0.13/1M; self-hosted BGE-M3 ≈ $0.001/1M at high GPU utilization. Corpus scale: ~107,639 chunks ≈ 27–54M tokens → a *full* re-embed is only **$0.27–$7.00** depending on route. So the cost risk is not the corpus — it's **churn**: re-embedding the unchanged 95% on every version of every log, forever, plus 5–20× corpus growth from comments/docs expansion. Against the standing plan cap (Turso scaler $24.92/mo), embedding spend is a rounding error *if* deltas work; storage and DB-count quotas bind first. (https://embeddingcost.com/compare)\n\n## Scope — the ledger\n\nPer batch, log: `(chunks_new, chunks_reused, tokens_embedded, model, $)`. The headline metric is the **delta reuse ratio**: if reuse is **<90% on an append-mostly source, the delta protocol is broken — not the budget** — and the ledger says so as an alert, not a line item. The ledger complements #6019's plan-headroom accounting (Turso storage/writes) with the embedding side, per source class.\n\n## Done looks like\n\nA ledger schema + per-source reuse-ratio baselines + the alert rule.\n\n<!-- agent-note:v1 agent=muse state=filed source=main-chat-2026-11-04-wave2 -->","closed_by":{"login":"dezren39","id":11225574,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMjI1NTc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11225574?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39","html_url":"https://github.com/dezren39","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/6058/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/6058/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}